ISSUE12_BLOCK {"id":192,"index":192,"interval":"Some(TrustedRunInterval { run_id: TrustedRunId(22), start: 2, end: 3 })","issues":"[]","pages":[11],"side":0,"text":"Claimed signatory From the verifier’s perspective, the claimed signatory is the entity that "}
