ISSUE12_BLOCK {"id":211,"index":211,"interval":"Some(TrustedRunInterval { run_id: TrustedRunId(23), start: 13, end: 14 })","issues":"[]","pages":[12],"side":0,"text":"2. (Collision resistant) It is computationally infeasible to find any "}
