ISSUE12_BLOCK {"id":1258,"index":1258,"interval":"Some(TrustedRunInterval { run_id: TrustedRunId(130), start: 19, end: 23 })","issues":"[]","pages":[63],"side":0,"text":"1. If nlen is neither 2048 nor 3072, then return (FAILURE, 0, 0). 2. If ((e ≤ 216) OR (e ≥ 2256) OR (e is not odd)), then return (FAILURE, 0, 0). 3. Set the value of security_strength in accordance with the value of nlen, as specified in SP 800-57, Part 1. "}
ISSUE12_BLOCK {"id":1259,"index":1259,"interval":"Some(TrustedRunInterval { run_id: TrustedRunId(130), start: 23, end: 24 })","issues":"[]","pages":[63],"side":0,"text":"4. If (len(seed) ≠ 2 * security_strength), then return (FAILURE, 0, 0). "}
