ISSUE12_BLOCK {"id":1548,"index":1548,"interval":"Some(TrustedRunInterval { run_id: TrustedRunId(147), start: 9, end: 10 })","issues":"[]","pages":[77],"side":0,"text":"An n-long sequence of bits { x1, …, xn } is converted to an integer by the rule "}
