ISSUE12_BLOCK {"id":1568,"index":1568,"interval":"Some(TrustedRunInterval { run_id: TrustedRunId(148), start: 2, end: 4 })","issues":"[]","pages":[78],"side":0,"text":"Note that the first bit of a sequence corresponds to the most significant bit of the corresponding integer, and the last bit corresponds to the least significant bit. "}
