ISSUE12_BLOCK {"id":2157,"index":2157,"interval":"Some(TrustedRunInterval { run_id: TrustedRunId(202), start: 22, end: 24 })","issues":"[]","pages":[101],"side":0,"text":"For each field degree m, a pseudo-random curve is given, along with a Koblitz curve. The pseudo-random curve has the form "}
