ISSUE12_BLOCK {"id":581,"index":581,"interval":"Some(TrustedRunInterval { run_id: TrustedRunId(70), start: 0, end: 1 })","issues":"[]","pages":[30],"side":1,"text":"The value k -1 = k -1 mod n is the multiplicative inverse of k with respect to multiplication modulo "}
