ISSUE12_BLOCK {"id":656,"index":656,"interval":"Some(TrustedRunInterval { run_id: TrustedRunId(81), start: 5, end: 7 })","issues":"[]","pages":[35],"side":1,"text":"For point decoding or “decompression,” square roots modulo p are needed. To decompress an encoded point for EdDSA: "}
