ISSUE12_BLOCK {"id":739,"index":739,"interval":"Some(TrustedRunInterval { run_id: TrustedRunId(87), start: 2, end: 3 })","issues":"[]","pages":[39],"side":1,"text":" "}
ISSUE12_BLOCK {"id":740,"index":740,"interval":"Some(TrustedRunInterval { run_id: TrustedRunId(87), start: 3, end: 5 })","issues":"[]","pages":[39],"side":1,"text":"6. Compute S = (r + digest × s) mod n. The octet string S is the encoding of the resultant integer. "}
ISSUE12_BLOCK {"id":741,"index":741,"interval":"Some(TrustedRunInterval { run_id: TrustedRunId(87), start: 5, end: 6 })","issues":"[]","pages":[39],"side":1,"text":"7. Form the signature as the concatenation of the octet strings R and S. "}
