ISSUE12_BLOCK {"id":1447,"index":1447,"interval":"Some(TrustedRunInterval { run_id: TrustedRunId(137), start: 4, end: 9 })","issues":"[]","pages":[69],"side":1,"text":"1. Set n, such that 2n > C ≥ 2(n−1). 2. m = n/2. 3. i = 0. 4. Select X0, such that 2m > X0 ≥ 2(m−1). 5. Repeat "}
ISSUE12_BLOCK {"id":1448,"index":1448,"interval":"Some(TrustedRunInterval { run_id: TrustedRunId(137), start: 9, end: 11 })","issues":"[]","pages":[69],"side":1,"text":"5.1 i = i + 1. 5.2 Xi = ((Xi–1)2 + C)/(2Xi–1). "}
