ISSUE12_BLOCK {"id":1454,"index":1454,"interval":"Some(TrustedRunInterval { run_id: TrustedRunId(137), start: 17, end: 18 })","issues":"[]","pages":[69],"side":1,"text":"Notes: "}
ISSUE12_BLOCK {"id":1455,"index":1455,"interval":"Some(TrustedRunInterval { run_id: TrustedRunId(137), start: 18, end: 19 })","issues":"[]","pages":[69],"side":1,"text":"1. By starting with X0 > (1/2) Sqrt(C), X0 − Sqrt(C)is guaranteed to be less than X0. This "}
ISSUE12_BLOCK {"id":1456,"index":1456,"interval":"Some(TrustedRunInterval { run_id: TrustedRunId(137), start: 19, end: 20 })","issues":"[]","pages":[69],"side":1,"text":"inequality is maintained in step 5; i.e., Xi − Sqrt(C)< Xi for all i. "}
ISSUE12_BLOCK {"id":1457,"index":1457,"interval":"Some(TrustedRunInterval { run_id: TrustedRunId(137), start: 20, end: 21 })","issues":"[]","pages":[69],"side":1,"text":"2. For i ≥ 1, 0 ≤ Xi − Sqrt(C) = (Xi–1 − Sqrt(C))2 / (2 Xi–1) < X0/2i. "}
ISSUE12_BLOCK {"id":1458,"index":1458,"interval":"Some(TrustedRunInterval { run_id: TrustedRunId(137), start: 21, end: 23 })","issues":"[]","pages":[69],"side":1,"text":"In particular, 0 ≤ Xm − Sqrt(C) < 1. If Sqrt(C) were an integer, then it would be equal to the floor of Xm. "}
ISSUE12_BLOCK {"id":1459,"index":1459,"interval":"Some(TrustedRunInterval { run_id: TrustedRunId(137), start: 23, end: 24 })","issues":"[]","pages":[69],"side":1,"text":"3. In general, the inequality Xi − Sqrt(C) < 1 will occur for values of i that are much less "}
ISSUE12_BLOCK {"id":1460,"index":1460,"interval":"Some(TrustedRunInterval { run_id: TrustedRunId(137), start: 24, end: 25 })","issues":"[]","pages":[69],"side":1,"text":"than m. To detect this, the fact that 2(m−1) ≤ Sqrt(C) < Xi for all i ≥ 1 can be used, "}
ISSUE12_BLOCK {"id":1461,"index":1461,"interval":"Some(TrustedRunInterval { run_id: TrustedRunId(137), start: 25, end: 28 })","issues":"[]","pages":[69],"side":1,"text":" Xi − Sqrt(C) = ((Xi)2 − C)/( Xi + Sqrt(C))  ≤ ((Xi)2 − C)/( 2 Sqrt(C))  ≤ ((Xi)2 − C)/(2m) "}
ISSUE12_BLOCK {"id":1462,"index":1462,"interval":"Some(TrustedRunInterval { run_id: TrustedRunId(137), start: 28, end: 29 })","issues":"[]","pages":[69],"side":1,"text":"Thus, the condition (Xi)2 < 2m + C implies that Xi − Sqrt(C) < 1. "}
