ISSUE12_VIEW {"blocks":[265,266,267,268,269,270,271,272],"index":58,"kind":"Trusted(TrustedRunId(29))","side":0,"tokens":" Signature validation The (mathematical) verification of the digital signature and obtaining the appropriate assurances (e.g., public key validity, private key possession, etc.). Signature verification The process of using a digital signature algorithm and a public key to verify a digital signature on data. Signed data The data or message upon which a digital signature has been computed. Also, see “message”. Subscriber An entity that has applied for and received a certificate from a Certificate Authority. "}
