ISSUE12_VIEW {"blocks":[735],"index":540,"kind":"Untrusted(735)","side":1,"tokens":"5.1 For Ed25519ph, digest = SHA-512(dom2(1, context ) || R || Q || h(M)). 5.2 For Ed448ph, digest = SHAKE256(dom4(1, context ) || R || Q || h(M), 912). Interpret digest as a little-endian integer. "}
