ISSUE12_VIEW {"blocks":[761],"index":566,"kind":"Untrusted(761)","side":1,"tokens":" It should be noted that even if it is feasible to compute collisions on the hash function (or XOF) used, there is believed to be no adverse effect on the security of EdDSA. This property is not true for HashEdDSA since collisions can result in forged messages. "}
